BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_317391755@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T073215Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/317391755/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261112T025820Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T025820Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_312627718@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T073215Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T213000
SUMMARY:Bowling in Rohnert park
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nCome out for a fun
  night of bowling! Whether you're a seasoned pro or haven't picked up a ba
 ll in years\, this is a great chance to hang out\, show off your skills (o
 r lack thereof)\, and enjoy some friendly competition.\nWe'll keep it casu
 al and lighthearted\, perfect for meeting new people and having a good tim
 e. Bring your best strike celebration and your sense of humor. We may grab
  food or drinks afterwards too!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/312627718/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20251229T193238Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251229T193238Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
